{"ID":"20240118151224-ptkt3ao","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151224-ptkt3ao","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151224-ptkt3ao\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151224-s151c2p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240130145328-d00ljvl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240130145328-d00ljvl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"128文蛤","type":"doc","updated":"20240130145328"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151224-s151c2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151224-s151c2p","updated":"20240122113525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】主恶疮，蚀五痔。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113527-mpznjbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113527-mpznjbe"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产东海之滨，壳表有文彩者佳。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113528-0muy1gf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113528-0muy1gf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113530-a86rv19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113530-a86rv19"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】主咳逆胸痹，腰痛胁急，女人崩中漏下，止烦渴，利小便，化痰软坚，敷治口鼻中蚀疳，恶疮五痔。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113531-6cm439o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113531-6cm439o"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一至二钱，外用无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113533-owym04m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113533-owym04m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】畏甘遂芫花，虽善消痰积血块，然脾胃虚寒者宜少用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113526-l9lk96p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113526-l9lk96p"}},{"ID":"20240122113533-gv2ryiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113533-gv2ryiv","updated":"20240130145324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一百二十八，文蛤啊，你看，也是东海之滨，这个文蛤跟海蛤的差异在哪里？文蛤一看，你看那个海边，整个壳子是一个的，那个海蛤呢，是已经几百年……被打散掉，变成一片一片的，本来还很大，变成一片一片的，那叫海蛤。那文蛤呢，是一块，整个的，所以拿起来，甲壳，你可以看到一个壳，半壳。那为什么我们会用它……经方……《神农本草经》里面说海蛤？是以意来取的。不是说我们中国以前用化学去分析。不是，是意来取的药，这个海蛤呢，它被切成一片一片的，本身就碎下来一片一片，你想象一下攻坚的力量强不强？打成一片一片的，那肿瘤被打散掉，要海蛤比文蛤好，这样想就好，那已经一片一片的，所以它的效果会高于那个，所以它同样是味咸性平，无毒，所以你如果说，化痰软坚，文蛤跟海蛤比较，海蛤绝对会比文蛤强很多。可是没有海蛤呢？文蛤也好嘛，那一般来说，这种外涂都可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240130145328-d00ljvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240130145328-d00ljvl"}}]}